{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Meal DNA 把廚房現有食材化為今晚想煮的菜式，適合想減少浪費、又不想花時間構思菜單的家庭煮食者。程式以食材庫與到期日為本，推薦可立即動手的食譜，並把缺少的材料一鍵加入購物清單。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-3.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>按存貨與到期日推薦食譜</h2>\n<p>勾選廚房常備食材後，App 會按存貨與到期日排序食譜，解答今晚可以煮甚麼。內建超過 1,000 道世界食譜，涵蓋印度、地中海及東亞風味，附步驟與份量。食材庫記錄數量與到期日，並在食物變壞前提醒，支援條碼掃描與拍照加入。另有每日晚餐建議、餐單計劃、熱量與營養素估算及購物清單。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-4-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-5-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Meal DNA: Pantry Meal Planner</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/meal-dna-pantry-meal-planner/id6772694980?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.215913+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T19:40:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:38:54.783977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:09.881465+00:00","content_hash":"7282062abe5aeda437584943c0c02333c3a2a2082bd214d6fb0d15add1011ce2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}